Scenario 2: Disk Usage Increases Every Hour

Symptoms

Today : 60%

After 1 hour : 70%

After 2 hours : 80%

Questions

Is log rotation configured?
Is Docker storing old images?
Is Kubernetes storing container logs?

Commands

docker system df
docker image prune
journalctl --disk-usage

