Scenario 6: Swap Usage is High

Check

   free -h

Output

   RAM Used

   95%

   Swap

   90%

Questions

   Why is swap bad?

Answer

   Swap uses disk instead of RAM.

   Disk is much slower.

   Applications become slow.

