Scenario 15: Cache Uses All Memory

   free -h

Used

   15GB

User thinks RAM is full.

Actually

   buff/cache

   12GB

Question

   Should we clear cache?

Answer

   No.

   Linux automatically reclaims cache when applications need memory.

