Performance Monitoring Tools Cheat Sheet
Tool           Purpose  Key Metrics
top            Live CPU, memory, processes   CPU%, MEM%, load
htop           Interactive process viewer CPU, memory, process tree
free -h           Memory overview   Used, free, cache, swap
vmstat 1       CPU, memory, swap, context switches r, b, si, so, cs, wa
iostat -xz 1         Disk I/O performance %util, await, svctm
iotop          Per-process disk I/O Read/write throughput
sar            Historical performance  CPU, memory, network, disk
mpstat -P ALL 1   Per-core CPU usage   %usr, %sys, %iowait
pidstat 1         Per-process CPU, memory, I/O  CPU%, MEM%, I/O
lsof              Open files and sockets  File descriptors, deleted files
ss -tulnp         Network sockets   Listening ports, active connections
dmesg Kernel      messages   OOM events, hardware errors
journalctl        Systemd logs   Service failures, boot logs
df -h          Filesystem usage  Used%, available space
du -sh         Directory size analysis Space consumed by directories